{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is a fast-paced action RPG focused on loot, dungeon crawling, and visceral combat. Answer the call of <strong>Bar-Ulduun</strong>, an ancient dwarven city of legend. Driven by glory, treasure, or duty, descend into the depths, battle deadly foes, and uncover the secrets that lie below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the depths as the mighty Warrior, the cunning Rogue, or the\u00a0enigmatic Mage, each wielding unique weapons, abilities, and play styles. Adapt, experiment, and uncover the legends buried deep within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/727b5d88ca2d239e9b1aa732afa01f3b.poster.avif?t=1772353048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/727b5d88ca2d239e9b1aa732afa01f3b.webm?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/727b5d88ca2d239e9b1aa732afa01f3b.mp4?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Crawling Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is an ARPG condensed to its core.\u00a0Descend, fight, loot, return to camp, and repeat. Face increasingly deadly challenges as you push deeper, growing stronger with each expedition, culminating in challenging boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/d38a673ab385c1423a4aec6d774a11d6.poster.avif?t=1772353048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/d38a673ab385c1423a4aec6d774a11d6.webm?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/d38a673ab385c1423a4aec6d774a11d6.mp4?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face Bar-Ulduun's ever-shifting depths? Each expedition will never be the same with procedurally generated dungeons, dynamic paths, quests, and unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/c4765ebacd0a738d373dfbac2bca8946.poster.avif?t=1772353048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/c4765ebacd0a738d373dfbac2bca8946.webm?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556700/extras/c4765ebacd0a738d373dfbac2bca8946.mp4?t=1772353048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  character with legendary equipment, powerful passives, and devastating abilities. Shape your path with multiple unique passive skill trees, each offering new avenues of character customisation. Will you become an unbreakable juggernaut by following the path of the <strong>Tower</strong>? Or embrace the <strong>Serpent</strong>\u2019s cunning, and strike with lethal poisons? Or will you walk your own path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 